# NOT ignored on purpose:
#   eval/cache/       committed so results reproduce with no API key
#   eval/fixtures/    committed so the batch is byte identical for a reviewer
#   report/index.html committed so a reviewer can open one file

# run output, regenerated by npm run eval
eval/fixtures/*/last-run.json

# The large corpus is 13MB and regenerates byte identically from its committed seed
# with `npm run gen:large`, so it is reproduced rather than cloned. dev and test ARE
# committed, at 2.7MB together, so the headline numbers reproduce with no extra step.
eval/fixtures/large/
